 game modes with adjustable difficulty settings, highly responsive 120Hz gameplay on Quest 2, 3, and 3S, and online leaderboards to measure your progress.", "short_description": "Develop lightning-fast reflexes as you evade, block, and parry an ever-accelerating barrage of unpredictable attacks. \n\nPerfect Guard is a fast-paced, arcade-style reaction trainer inspired by martial arts, designed to challenge and enhance your speed and coordination.\n\nFeaturing multiple game modes with adjustable difficulty settings, highly responsive 120Hz gameplay on Quest 2, 3, and 3S, and online leaderboards to measure your progress."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.causalchain.net/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Causal Chain", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.causalchain.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27459062980451948"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_2146930706258760_2767771225707511966_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dlEgpHtky68Q7kNvwGcO6Nv&_nc_oc=AdoUzJ30eLI2JwxnxuDxxDe1Z18ztdGTBjeMswCjEK79tTs65Ffy-Vi0WYmxainjVh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=